    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izu daYehova denjili cheŋi kudami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Eyi mwana kamuntu, profwetaku, wili neyi, Mwanta Yehova nindi, Kalokenu! Yayo, o difuku! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa ifuku didi kwakwihi, ifuku daYehova didi kwakwihi, hiifuku damavu, dampinji yanyuza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpoku yakabali yakayiwana aEjipitu, muEtiyopiya mwakekala kutiya kumuchima ŋati, hakadimbukawu akajahawu muEjipitu. Akafumishaku luntu lwindi, niyikuku yindi akayihumona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AEtiyopiya, niaPuti, niaLudi, niantu ejima akubombashana, niaKubi, niantu amwituŋa datiyaloŋana chitiyaŋenu, akadimbuka hamu nawena kumpoku yakabali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Niwena akakwasha aEjipitu akadimbuka, niŋovu jindi jaditembayi jakafwomoka. Akadimbokamu nampoku yakabali kufumisha kukaposhi kakuSevene. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Mwanta Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akekala kwamahembi hohu, mukachi kamatuŋa anekali dehi kwamahembi hohu, nyikala yindi yakekala mukachi kanyikala yanakisaŋanuwu dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinakasha kesi mwituŋa daEjipitu, chakajilumukawu ankwashi jindi ejima, akeluka nawu yami Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hefuku odu kwakafuma antemesha akufuma kumesu ami, akaya mumaatu nakuyitiyisha aEtiyopiya adiwujola woma; kwakayiwana yuma yakutiya nikumuchima ŋati, neyi chamwenuwu hefuku daEjipitu; muloŋa tala, oyu yikwinzoyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta Yehova nahoshi nindi, Nakakumisha luntu lwaEjipitu nachikasa chamwanta wakuBabiloni Nebukaneza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena hamu nawantu indi, wowu amunyuza atiyawu woma, akayiletamu kulonda akajilumuni ituŋa. Akayiholela aEjipitu mpoku jawu jatubali, akenzesha ituŋa nawantu akajahawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakomisha tuloŋa, ituŋa nakadilandisha mumakasa awantu atama. Niituŋa niyuma yejima yekalamu nakabalumuna kwamahembi hohu namakasa awantu akumatuŋa acheŋi. Ami Yehova nahoshumu dehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta Yehova nindi, Nakajilumuna nawa niakishi akutuŋa, nakakumisha niakishi akuNofwi. Hikwakekala nawa cheŋi kalamba kakufuma mwituŋa daEjipituku; nakasha woma mwituŋa daEjipitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "NiPatirosi nakamubalumuna kwamahembi hohu, nakasha kesi muZowani, muNo nakakoŋamu yakubabesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakechila kulendumuka kwami haSini hadikaŋilawu aEjipitu; nakakumisha luntu lwaNo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakasha kesi muEjipitu; Sini wakatiya kumuchima ŋati, No wakahumuka; Nofwi wakamona ayilumbu mwaana wejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyikwenzi akuAvene nakuPibeseti akadimbuka nampoku yakabali, nyikaloyu yakaya muwukoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinakakotola mpanda jaEjipitu kuTehafweneliesi mwaana wakeyila, niŋovu jindi jaditembayi jakamukuma. Yena nawa ivu dakamubuta, anyanindi awambanda akaya muwukoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MuEjipitu nakakoŋa munasompeshi. Akeluka nawu yami Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumwaka wekumi nakamu, mukakweji kamu, mwifuku dakakweji dakatanu nakayedi, izu daYehova denjili kudami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Eyi mwana kamuntu, ami nakotoli chikasa chamwanta wakuEjipitu Fwaro. Talenu, hiyanachikasi kukasa kwakusha yitumbuku, hiyanajiŋaji ŋuhu ihina kulonda chakakoli, chakakwati kumpoku yakabaluku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Mwanta Yehova nindi, Tiyenu, mwanta wakuEjipitu Fwaro nidi nindi nandombu, nakakotola makasindi, nichakola nichakotokeli dehi, nakamuholwesha mpoku yakabali muchikasa chindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakaŋalaŋesha aEjipitu mukachi kanyuza, nakayimwaŋila mwahita matuŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakakolesha makasa amwanta wakuBabiloni, muchikasa chindi nakashamu mpoku yami yakabali; nakakotola makasa aFwaro, wakaabila kumesu indi kwaba kwaabaŋa muntu anatapuwu chakufwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakamukwatilila mwanta wakuBabiloni makasindi kwiwulu, makasa aFwaro akalepuka. Chinakasha mpoku yami yakabali muchikasa chamwanta wakuBabiloni, chakachololayi hetuŋa daEjipitu, akeluka nawu yami Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakaŋalaŋeshela aEjipitu munyuza, nakayimwaŋila mwahita matuŋa. Akeluka nawu yami Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
